  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d26ac1d0da42d95",
      "translationZh": "我想看看，用一个庞大的 MoE 模型，能把一台相当普通的笔记本电脑的极限推到哪里。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "848e6370c6c87edf",
      "translationZh": "结果发现，Qwen3.8 Flash Next 176B 可以在以下配置上运行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f528b340cf9056bd",
      "translationZh": "RTX 3080 Laptop — 16GB 显存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b7ed1b4ebc6fa83",
      "translationZh": "不需要配备 128GB/256GB 内存的工作站，也不需要多 GPU 配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "521030b7c11f736f",
      "translationZh": "我正在用 TensorSharp 运行它，这是我开源的本地 LLM 推理引擎：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84e0ae75081bb82e",
      "translationZh": "对我来说，有意思的不只是让一个 176B 模型成功加载。我想让一个远大于可用显存和内存容量的模型真正用得起来。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc187c1bed700d6c",
      "translationZh": "基本思路是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9488649901e335dd",
      "translationZh": "量化 + 感知 MoE 特性的统一调度，涵盖缓存、显存、系统内存和 SSD。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4e719d52899f54a7",
      "translationZh": "TensorSharp 并不将 SSD 视为最后才启用的交换空间，而是围绕 MoE 的执行来协调不同的内存与存储层级，力求在恰当的时间，将所需的专家/数据放在恰当的层级中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "065b1613846d2f32",
      "translationZh": "我之前对 TensorSharp 和 llama.cpp 做过基准测试，结果非常令人鼓舞。这次我想将它与 Strata 进行比较，因为 Strata 在内存受限的情况下运行大模型的方法特别有意思。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fbf7a80786b162aa",
      "translationZh": "以下是所附基准测试的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff1858b359ec001f",
      "translationZh": "测量指标 TensorSharp Strata",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "38b4b8880f2d14e2",
      "translationZh": "解码吞吐量相当接近：11.09 对 10.24 tok/s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e5bf3f61d512894",
      "translationZh": "更让我惊讶的是端到端结果：在这次测试中，分别为 16.54s 和 62.15s。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "47d9c64c9fb50778",
      "translationZh": "我认为，这为本地 LLM 推理指出了一个有意思的方向。对于庞大的稀疏 MoE 模型，问题可能不只是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fa48c3650ce1350d",
      "translationZh": "“我的 RAM/VRAM 是否足够装下这个模型？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d228b0baf495524a",
      "translationZh": "“运行时能以多高的效率协调 VRAM、RAM、SSD、缓存和专家激活？”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "079d36b358481e4b",
      "translationZh": "采用合适的量化和内存层级结构，你显然可以在消费级硬件上做到一些相当离谱的事情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a9c7b06f1da93938",
      "translationZh": "如果这里有人用 llama.cpp、Strata 或其他 MoE/卸载实现试过同一个模型，我会特别感兴趣。能在类似的硬件上比较结果就太好了。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b853053f39deca92",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/fuzhongkai 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
